# Project Charter & Scope Governance Template

> **Purpose:** Establish unambiguous business objectives, measurable KPIs, commercial guardrails, and strict In/Out-of-Scope boundaries prior to Sprint 1. Designed to prevent scope creep and align executive, technical, and legal stakeholders from Day 1.

---

