## 3. Measurable Success Criteria (SMART KPIs)

| Objective Category | KPI Metric | Current Baseline | Target Outcome | Source of Truth |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Delivery Speed** | End-to-end rollout timeline | `[N/A]` | `100% On-Time (X Weeks)` | Jira / Milestone Tracker |
| **Commercial / P&L** | Budget variance & TCO | `[Planned Budget]` | `≤ Planned Budget (3-Yr TCO optimized)` | Finance Ledger / Invoices |
| **Operational Efficiency** | Cycle / turn time reduction | `[Baseline Value]` | `[Target % or Time Reduction]` | POS / Analytics Logs |
| **Quality & Adoption** | Error rate / CSAT | `[Baseline %]` | `[e.g., ≥ 85% CSAT, ≥ 99% Accuracy]` | QA Logs / User Surveys |

